      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺は神を殺したい。神は長命だが人と同じ命を持つ。\nならば命を刈り続ければ、神殺しに至る道理。\n道半ばだが、抜かば魂散る、必殺の刃を編み出した。\n誰かを斬りたくて堪らない。試し斬りをさせてくれ。",
        "official_en": "I yearn to slay a god. They live long, but still—it is\njust a life, and can be cut short. I believe my blade\ntechnique would scatter their souls. Yours too, just\nas easily. Shall we test it?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
